- linearizable off: final enabled re-check after the session lock is
  acquired, immediately before assemble/commit; a candidate that crossed
  the barrier is restored and rejected with the lock released
- persistence semantics: _speculative_runtime_override marker; model
  switches and in-place updates reset to config-driven wiring via
  reset_speculative_compression_to_config; status reports the override
  and the eligibility blocker
- configure_speculative_compression refactored onto shared
  _config_speculative_settings/_apply_speculative_settings so /on works
  for agents constructed with compression disabled (manager attached
  when eligible)
- accounting: no-progress speculative installs feed
  _record_ineffective_compression_verdict on the live compressor and the
  speculative progress verdict survives session-rebinding callbacks
- gateway: busy-dispatch routing + cache rebuild-once asserted; no
  separate command allowlist exists (registry-based access control)
- CLI + gateway integration tests for /speculative on|off|status with
  authoritative replies

82 required + 61 regression tests green; default still disabled.
