MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Addresses terra round-3 review (1 critical + 2 major + 1 minor):

- critical: epoch fencing makes /speculative off linearizable — off and
  reset bump agent._speculative_epoch after clearing the flag; the
  install path captures the epoch before the lock wait and aborts
  (rejected, lock released, no restore) at the post-lock gate AND again
  immediately before assemble/commit, closing the commit-after-off window
- major: off is absolute cancel — a candidate claimed before off is
  dropped, never restored; restoration remains only for deferred_lock
- major: reset_speculative_compression_to_config invalidates the
  session's manager entry (cancels the running worker future) before
  detaching the manager
- minor: post-gate barrier test (pause in matches() after the gate,
  toggle off, assert no session rewrite), real gateway cache rebuild
  test through the runner config path, off-cancel spy test

91 focused + regression tests green; default still disabled.
