Subject: [PATCH 25/35] feat(tui): near-live usage gauge during tool loops
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The status-line context gauge only moved after each completed model round,
so long tool loops froze the readout. Now each tool result pushes a
throttled (1 Hz/session) session.info whose context_used is estimated from
the live transcript when no new last_prompt_tokens exists yet — the gauge
tracks the conversation as it grows, and the estimate is clamped to never
under-report the last real round. Emits even when tool-progress UI is off
(the usage gauge is the consumer); tool lifecycle stays hidden.
