322k speculative soft trigger and the 414k normal threshold).

matches() fingerprints only the prefix + boundary message, so an
appended tool result does not invalidate a ready candidate — a soft
claim at the post-tool check is safe. Regression test keeps
should_compress False for the whole turn and proves the candidate is
still installed.
